  "sourceTitle": "Onion Cookies",
  "sourceText": "Onion Cookies\nBy: Helen Pitlick\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 large onions\n1 cup oil\n1 tablespoon salt\n1 teaspoon baking soda\n1/4 cup water\n2 eggs\n4 cups flour\n2 tablespoons poppy seeds\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cut onions very thin. Add all other ingredients. Roll very thin on floured board. Cut into rounds or squares. Bake in 400 degree oven 10 to 15 minutes until golden brown.",
